# added as a 90-day band-aid in #1907) were removed here — superseded by the
# durable fix: gitleaks now runs with --log-opts="HEAD" (no more cross-branch
# --all-refs scanning) AND a path allowlist in .gitleaks.toml for
# __tests__/integration/e2e/bake/__snapshots__/*.json (structural fix for the
# false-positive class, not just this one commit).
